{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16863","headline":"江上送别 · 朱放","name":"江上送别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浦边新见柳摇时，北客相逢只自悲。\n惆怅空知思後会，艰难不敢料前期。\n行看汉月愁征战，共折江花怨别离。\n向夕孤城分首处，寂寥横笛爲君吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱放","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}